tps://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1417291330145161_4034415957207942165_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MqacKZCBQ3UQ7kNvwEl56Bx&_nc_oc=AdqVuhTOmoilIzRhAhorg2f9SixrT4JU3H20Yb_xTMJ33mcyKYdOvaO4gZsBbzpmD8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyDeWOQczBBAbYrL_QEM0xy9QZ_TV6xNYMmXHGjCv5XuQ&oe=69C91A63"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_LevelB.png", "id": "1445449703796085", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1445449707129418_682613086355427551_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SSD8oN5ITe0Q7kNvwFM25Hv&_nc_oc=Adp-tC1EDR6EsL8dVT5j0Ijbr_91EAPct1NcXYraOii8UcuPQ2P9oKCnM0zMrLIUNBY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwGC_2TgezR4WZIOWAUq-A9kbDy5c8uzdDBJHZRCdQ87w&oe=69C928BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_V13.png", "id": "1442180897362325", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_1442180904028991_8459632152041241683_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tXfkuc_IhiEQ7kNvwHeWT6Q&_nc_oc=AdrX2EaMnUZULP7EeyUC4VYttr-OQ5dsZxIEpW6WimBc-C2ObS7ubS87Xbi5iKlq3sM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz6hdl6frgCNvs0yQm5Gl4YKc2Gv6Q22jb2eKURQOHs8g&oe=69C9350A"}, "display_name": "Table Troopers", "keywords": ["Artillery", "Multiplayer", "Party", "Turnbased", "BadEgg"], "long_description": "# Your room is the battlefield and your troopers are chickens?!\n\nJump into **chaotic, turn-based** warfare where bad decisions are permanent, wind can ruin the perfect shot, and that cover you trust? \nIt's about to crumble! \n\nFight friends, outsmart strangers, or conquer the campaign in explosive **VR** and **Mixed Reality**. \n\nEvery shot matters. Every structure can fall. Every round plays differently.\n\n{1248063757259667}\n# CASUAL MULTIPLAYER CHAOS\nBattle with up to 4 players in matches that turn friendly hangouts into full-scale showdowns. Team up, settle scores, or create new rivalries!\n\n{931935249586123}\n# SKILL-BASED PHYSICS COMBAT\nAngle, power, wind direction \u2014 precision wins the fight! One miscalculation can send you flying. Physics-driven gameplay rewards strategy and punishes overconfidence.\n\n{1557596489705447}\n# FULLY DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENTS\nWhoops, that pillar was load-bearing! Dynamic destruction reshapes the battlefield with every explosion. No position is safe forever!\n\n# PLAY YOUR WAY:\n- Up to 4-player Versus (public or private)\n- Solo Campaign: 4 chapters, 18 handcrafted maps\n- Challenge Mode with rewards\n- Full VR or Mixed Reality\n- Easy access: colorblind modes, controllers, hand tracking\n\nWhether you execute a perfect tactical strike or accidentally destroy your own cover, no two matches unfold the same way!\n\nWant early updates, playtests, and dev chats?\n# Join the Discord: \ud83d\udd17 **discord.tabletroopers.com**\n\nSee you on the battlefield, Trooper!", "short_description": "Table Troopers puts you in command of a fully destructible battlefield, combining hands-on physics based action with turn-based tactical depth.\nCommand quirky characters and wield powerful weapons to defeat your enemies."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2115085199314197", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Table Troopers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Table Troopers vous place aux commandes d\u2019un champ de bataille **enti\u00e8rement destructible**, m\u00ealant action **bas\u00e9e sur la physique** et combat au tour par tour avec des commandes intuitives.\n\nDirigez des personnages excentriques et **maniez des armes puissantes** pour vaincre vos ennemis !\n\n# Causez des d\u00e9g\u00e2ts massifs\n{819660767055152}\n\n{900313149395777}\n\n# Jouez en ligne avec vos amis\n{1435333001720358}\n\n# Fonctionnalit\u00e9s principales :\n**Campagne solo :** Traversez trois chapitres explosifs\n\n**Multijoueur :** Jouez en ligne avec vos amis\n\n**Combat tactique :** Strat\u00e9gie au tour par tour avec un chaos bas\u00e9 sur la physique et des environnements destructibles.\n\n**Action bas\u00e9e sur la physique :** Utilisez votre habilet\u00e9 pour viser et d\u00e9clencher un chaos bas\u00e9 sur la physique\n\n**Environnements destructibles :** Faites exploser tout le niveau\n\n**Nombreuses armes :** Utilisez une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019armes avec des caract\u00e9ristiques diff\u00e9rentes\n\n**R\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte :** Un champ de bataille dynamique fusionne votre pi\u00e8ce avec le monde virtuel ou jouez en immersion totale en VR\n\n**Moments amusants :** Des incidents hilarants et des victoires \u00e9piques.\n\n# Impliquez-vous et rejoignez notre Discord : \ud83d\udd17 **https://discord.tabletroopers.com**", "short_description": "Table Troopers vous place aux commandes d\u2019un champ de bataille enti\u00e8rement destructible, combinant une action physique directe avec une profondeur tactique au tour par tour.\nDirigez des personnages excentriques et maniez des armes puissantes pour vaincre vos ennemis."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1478003003670426", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Table Troopers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Table Troopers ti mette al comando di un campo di battaglia **completamente distruttibile**, mescolando un'azione **basata sulla fisica** e combattimenti a turni con controlli intuitivi.\n\nComanda personaggi stravaganti e **utilizza armi potenti** per sconfiggere i tuoi nemici!\n\nCausa danni enormi\n{1245431616949368}{3487187204771562}\n\n# Gioca online con i tuoi amici\n{26129575706654876}\n\n# Caratteristiche principali:\n**Campagna per giocatore singolo:** Supera tre capitoli esplosivi\n\n**Multigiocatore:** Gioca online con i tuoi amici\n\n**Combattimento tattico:** Strategia a turni con caos guidato dalla fisica e ambienti distruttibili.\n\n**Azione basata sulla fisica:** Usa la tua abilit\u00e0 per mirare e scatenare il caos guidato dalla fisica\n\n**Ambienti distruttibili:** Fai esplodere l'intero livello\n\n**Molte armi:** Usa una variet\u00e0 di armi con caratteristiche diverse\n\n**Realt\u00e0 mista:** Un campo di battaglia dinamico fonde la tua stanza con il mondo virtuale o gioca in modo completamente immersivo in VR\n\n**Momenti divertenti:** Incidenti esilaranti e vittorie epiche.\n\n# Partecipa e unisciti al nostro Discord: \ud83d\udd17 **https://discord.tabletroopers.com** ", "short_description": "Table Troopers ti mette al comando di un campo di battaglia completamente distruttibile, combinando un'azione fisica diretta con una profondit\u00e0 tattica a turni.\nComanda personaggi stravaganti e utilizza armi potenti per sconfiggere i tuoi nemici."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1275005541268152", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Table Troopers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Table Troopers te pone al mando de un **campo de batalla completamente destructible**, combinando acci\u00f3n **basada en f\u00edsica** y combate por turnos con controles intuitivos.\n\n\u00a1Comanda personajes peculiares y **usa armas poderosas** para derrotar a tus enemigos!\n\n# Causa da\u00f1os masivos\n{1668025414572248}{888156653828653}\n\n# Juega en l\u00ednea con tus amigos\n{1304546891449013}\n\n# Caracter\u00edsticas principales:\n**Campa\u00f1a para un jugador:** Avanza a trav\u00e9s de tres cap\u00edtulos\n\n**Multijugador:** Juega en l\u00ednea con tus amigos\n\n**Combate t\u00e1ctico:** Estrategia por turnos con caos impulsado por f\u00edsica y entornos destructibles.\n\n**Acci\u00f3n basada en f\u00edsica:** Usa tu habilidad para apuntar y desatar caos impulsado por f\u00edsica\n\n**Entornos destructibles:** Destruye todo el nivel\n\n**Variedad de armas:** Usa una variedad de armas con diferentes caracter\u00edsticas\n\n**Realidad mixta:** Un campo de batalla din\u00e1mico fusiona tu habitaci\u00f3n con el mundo virtual o juega completamente inmerso en RV\n\n**Momentos divertidos:** Accidentes hilarantes y victorias \u00e9picas.\n\n# Participa y \u00fanete a nuestro Discord: \ud83d\udd17 **https://discord.tabletroopers.com**", "short_description": "Table Troopers te pone al mando de un campo de batalla completamente destructible, combinando acci\u00f3n basada en f\u00edsica con profundidad t\u00e1ctica por turnos.\nComanda personajes peculiares y usa armas poderosas para derrotar a tus enemigos."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.cosmorama.com/privacy-policy-4/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "COSMORAMA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tabletroopers.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "fr", "es", "it", "ko", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26342357475375751"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_2268858146973228_6622732682510602702_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fsCzpNw3JxEQ7kNvwETQtT2&_nc_oc=AdpQ0lTMe1LVmzNLo907u4LPA-SMvpgWGNw4bLyh